referenceFunction.generalComment:
Production of photovoltaic thin film modules by thermal vaporization in vacuum. The modules produced at NICE Solar Energy have a size of 0.72m2. The weight is 18.5kg/m2. The specific maximum power is 95 Wp/m2.;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, copper indium selenide, thin film, CIGS; 
UUID: caceba9d-63d2-3378-986d-39bbf154c005
